From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: thanhan92-f1 <thanhan92-f1@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 10:16:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(locale): add Vietnamese (vi / vi-VN) locale

- bundle a full Vietnamese translation of LocaleDataType.localeStrings
  (VietnameseLocale.res); it is selected for the vi / vi-VN / vi_VN
  configuration locale and is not fetched from the asset CDN
- keep the raw configured locale code in configuration.localeCode, since
  LocaleDataType.localeTypes (shared-code submodule) has no Vietnamese
  variant; send vi-VN as browser_info.language
- add HiTechPayLocale with the display names of viet_qr, momo_atm,
  local_bank_redirect and momo for every supported locale (VietQR,
  MoMo ATM, Domestic bank / Ngan hang noi dia, MoMo / Vi MoMo) and the
  English / Vietnamese strings of the QR payment screen

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014p7hcqtGKsGWvEUtmq6YEC

